  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-session-curator",
      "text": "**English** | [中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nA DSH (DeepSeek Harness) plugin that adds **session deletion** and **archive management**.\n\nDSH can archive and pin a session but offers no API to delete one. This plugin does the file-level work itself, and deletion is **permanent**: the session directory and its projection cache are removed from disk. If you want to be able to bring a session back later, **archive it instead** — archiving also hides it from the sidebar and is fully reversible."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "| Where | What |\n| --- | --- |\n| Session row `⋯` menu | **Delete session** — permanently removes it from disk after a confirmation |\n| Settings → **Session manager** | Two tabs — **archived / pinned** — grouped by the session's original workspace folder, with per-row and bulk actions |\n| Settings → **Session manager** → **Settings** | Basics (default tab, grouping, **sidebar archived visibility**, row details, order), the installed version, and an upgrade hint with the exact command when npm has a newer release |\n| Confirmation dialog | Permanent deletion; it warns that this cannot be undone and hints to use **Archive** instead, and needs an explicit \"I cannot undo this\" tick |\n| Disk usage tab | Read-only totals plus largest / least-recently-opened sessions, each archivable in place |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "Deletion is permanent and never touches a running session (or the session currently in use). Anything you want to keep should be archived instead."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```powershell"
    },
    {
      "section": "desktop profile",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-session-curator"
    },
    {
      "section": "web profile",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-session-curator\n```\n\nFrom GitHub instead of npm:\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add github:Motues/dsh-session-curator\n```\n\nThe command runs pnpm inside that profile and records the package in both `dependencies` and `dsh.profile.bundles`. Restart DSH to pick up the host half; the client half only needs a page refresh."
    },
    {
      "section": "web profile",
      "text": "The published package is dependency-free and needs no build: `lib/` is plain ESM JavaScript(`lib/index.js` for the host half, `lib/client.js` for the client bundle). Sources live in `src/` as TypeScript; contributors run `pnpm install` once and `pnpm run build` (tsc for the host half, esbuild for the client bundle) to regenerate `lib/`."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-session-curator",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | **中文**\n\n给 DSH（DeepSeek Harness）补上**删除会话**与**归档会话管理**的插件。\n\nDSH 能归档和置顶会话，却没有删除会话的 API。这个插件自己做文件级操作，删除是**真正的物理删除**：会话目录连同投影缓存一起从磁盘移除。如果想以后还能找回，请改用**归档** —— 归档同样能让会话从侧边栏消失，而且随时可以恢复。"
    },
    {
      "section": "能力",
      "text": "| 位置 | 内容 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 会话行 `⋯` 菜单 | **删除会话** —— 确认后从磁盘永久删除 |\n| 设置 → **会话管理** | 两个页签：**已归档 / 已置顶**，按会话原来的工作区文件夹分组，支持逐行与批量操作 |\n| 设置 → **会话管理** → **配置** | 基础设置（默认页签 / 分组 / **侧边栏是否显示已归档** / 行内信息 / 排序）、当前版本号，以及 npm 上有新版本时的升级提示与命令 |\n| 确认弹窗 | 物理删除：写明\"不可恢复\"并提示改用「归档」，需要勾选\"我明白这无法撤销\" |\n| 磁盘占用页签 | 只读的占用合计 + 最占地方 / 最久没打开的榜单，榜单每行可直接归档 |\n\n删除不可逆，且绝不会碰正在运行、或当前正在使用的会话。想留退路就用归档。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```powershell"
    },
    {
      "section": "desktop profile",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-session-curator"
    },
    {
      "section": "web profile",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-session-curator\n```\n\n从 GitHub 装（不走 npm）：\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add github:Motues/dsh-session-curator\n```\n\n这条命令在那个 profile 目录里跑 pnpm，并把这个包同时记进 `dependencies` 和 `dsh.profile.bundles`。宿主半区需要重启 DSH 生效，客户端半区刷新页面即可。\n\n发布出去的包零运行时依赖、安装方无需构建：`lib/` 就是普通 ESM JavaScript（`lib/index.js` 宿主半区，`lib/client.js` 客户端束）。源码是 `src/` 下的 TypeScript：贡献者 `pnpm install` 一次，再用`pnpm run build`（宿主半区走 tsc、客户端束走 esbuild）重新生成 `lib/`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    }
  ],
